[31m+[39m
[31m+ - A changed UI is not ready to hand off or merge while any required screenshot is missing. Capture each applicable page, tab/state and desktop, tablet and mobile viewport through its standard test, from the exact committed build. Fix capture failures and rerun; a green assertion alone is insufficient.[39m
[31m+ - Register and retain the original image bytes, hashes, unit, state, viewport, served build and revision in Harness evidence before temporary workspace cleanup. A scratch path, broken image URL or image in chat is not durable screenshot delivery.[39m
