[31m+ - Public category or route renames must inventory canonical and compatibility titles and links. Update exposed labels, preserve stable IDs and aliases, and extend the standard composition check across overview, details and history. Run affected downstream consumer tests alongside their typechecks. Run the affected package lint and audit as well.[39m
[31m+ - Full-frame previews own their content boundaries. Apply content-container styling inside the frame, never around its navigation. When changing fixture context, extend the existing standard acceptance assertions for affected controls and inspect retained pixels before accepting the UI.[39m
[31m+ - Resolve a scenario screenshot slot to its declared units. A slot name is not a page identity; never fill a missing preview with another page's image.[39m
